'''<samp>tile.mod_ore.0.name</samp>''' is a block used for developing ores, addons, or otherwise used for development purposes.{{more info|Include more examples.}} It uses the same texture as the [[block of gold]].

== Obtaining ==
<samp>tile.mod_ore.0.name</samp> can only be obtained via [[commands]].

=== Breaking ===
{{expand section|Add the block's breaking time.}}
The block takes about 2 seconds to mine by hand.{{More info}}

When mined, <samp>tile.mod_ore.0.name</samp> does not drop anything, regardless of the tool used. The item can only be dropped by [[explosion|exploding]] it or by using the {{cmd|setblock}} command.<ref>{{ytl|GXwLg-vHbdU|Weird features only in Minecraft China Edition|Element X
|October 20, 2022}}</ref>

